## Athletics

I competed as a national-level middle-distance runner with Atletica Mogliano between 2008 and 2018. That experience continues to shape my interest in sport data, longitudinal performance and the relationship between statistical evidence and decisions made by athletes and coaches.

## Coaching

I hold an entry-level coaching qualification from the Italian Athletics Federation and have experience coaching young athletes.

Sport remains part of my life and provides a useful counterpoint to academic work: performance is measurable, but rarely reducible to a single number or model.
